<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
 <head>
 <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" />
 <title>
 Untitled Document
 </title>
 <style type="text/css">
 body {
 height: 100%;
 font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
 color: #525252;
 background-color: #ffffff;
 margin: 0;
 display: flex;
 align-items: center;
 justify-content: center;
 }
 
 .form-container {
 background: #F5F5F5;
 border-radius: 12px;
 
 border:1px solid #444;
 
 }
 .form-container a {
 color: #ADB5BD;
 text-align: center;
 font-size: 16px;
 font-style: normal;
 font-weight: 400;
 text-decoration: underline;
 }
 
 .form-container button.primary {
 display: block;
 width: 100%;
 height: 50px;
 padding: 12px;
 justify-content: center;
 align-items: center;
 gap: 8px;
 align-self: stretch;
 color: #FFF;
 font-size: 16px;
 font-weight: 600;
 cursor: pointer;
 border-radius: 6px;
 background: #ADB5BD;
 border: none;
 margin-top: 32px;
 }
 .form-container button.primary:hover {
 border-radius: 4px;
 background: #4E4E4E;
 height: 50px;
 padding: 12px;
 justify-content: center;
 align-items: center;
 color: #FFF;
 }
 .form-container button {
 display: block;
 width: 100%;
 height: 50px;
 padding: 12px;
 justify-content: center;
 align-items: center;
 gap: 8px;
 align-self: stretch;
 color: #4E4E4E;
 font-size: 16px;
 font-weight: 600;
 cursor: pointer;
 border-radius: 6px;
 border:1px solid #4E4E4E;
 margin-top: 32px;
 }
 .form-container button:hover {
 border-radius: 4px;
 background: #4E4E4E;
 height: 50px;
 padding: 12px;
 justify-content: center;
 align-items: center;
 color: #FFF;
 }
 .box-titulo {
 border-radius: 12px 12px 0px 0px;
 display: flex;
 padding: 20px;
 color: #fff;
 align-self: stretch;
 background: #444;
 text-transform: none;
 }
 .box-titulo h1{
 margin: 0px;
 }
 </style>
 </head>
 
 <body style="text-align:center">
 <div class="form-container">
 <div class="box-titulo">
 <h1>
 Página Web Bloqueada
 </h1>
 </div>
 <div style="padding: 20px;">
 <p>
 <br />
 Você tentou acessar uma página da web que viola sua política de uso da Internet.
 <br />
 <br />
 
 URL: images.unsplash.com/?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80
 <br />
 Category: File Sharing and Storage
 <br />
 <br />
 
 Qualquer dúvida entrar em contato com o suporte. 
 </p>
 </div>
 </div>
 </body>
</html>
